     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><div><br>On Tuesday, October 14, 2014 7:52:55 AM UTC-7, Fereshteh Karimeddini wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Chris,<div><br></div><div>Thanks for reporting this issue. I opened <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/618\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/618&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364555534000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1q51bb3O7-_ACJ5w4D9J7w\">this ticket</a> for the issue.</div><div><br></div><div>For future, if you run into issues or questions about Shiny package, it would be better to post them to this forum:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/shiny-discuss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!forum/shiny-discuss&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364555535000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0uCLcGCeJH_kIqNNmtEA-0\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/shiny-discuss</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Fereshteh</div><div><br></div><div><br><br>On Tuesday, October 14, 2014 5:20:51 AM UTC-4, Chris B. wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>This error is reproducible and occurs with the <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/commit/f2b16c414f35d1bfd6229587f4d98ec76c0d5759\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/commit/f2b16c414f35d1bfd6229587f4d98ec76c0d5759&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364555535000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0sImdoZy2soGU3UFUqJwmV\">latest changes</a> to shiny.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Running the example of observeEvent() or eventFilter() gives the following error:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">binary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">No</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> handler registered </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type saveButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">actionButton</span></font></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>That said, all previous shiny apps utilising actionButton() in &quot;legacy mode&quot; (i.e. as in the example of actionButton()) return the same error and stop working as soon as a button is pressed.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>Example of observeEvent()</b></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">## Not run: </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># In ui.R:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">basicPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  numericInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;n&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Number of observations&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;saveButton&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Save&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># In server.R:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$saveButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    write</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">csv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">runif</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> file </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">## End(Not run)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><b>Session info</b></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sessionInfo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>R version </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2014</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">07</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Platform</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x86_64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mingw32</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x64 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>locale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> LC_COLLATE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">English_United</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Kingdom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1252</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  LC_CTYPE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">English_United</span><span style=\"c